+ * with the mutators still suspended AND the collection finished, i.e. from
+ * sgen_client_collection_end (see mono_gc_walk_heap's own contract in sgen-mono.c). The handle
+ * scan runs with the world RUNNING instead, from an ordinary icall, because it only reads handle
+ * slots and must not observe a collector mid-rewrite.
